      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PRINCESS DOMI (1) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing sixth (28.53) in a Grade 5 at Bendigo. Goes very well from this draw with four wins and three minor placings from 10 starts. Should be very hard to beat this time. MONEY SCIENCE (6) produced a moderate effort last time when sixth at this track over 525m behind Where's Nassif (30.95) in a Grade 5. Was a winner prior to that. Likely to be thereabouts. REV IAN (8) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing second behind Wyong Houston (30.54) in a Grade 5. Has the pace to be prominent. The form from his last run stacks up well. Expected to be in this for a long way. ZIPPING ANDORA (2) with some luck can improve on an unplaced run last time here.",
